This node pack is an unofficial integration. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the EMA Lightning authors or by Comfy Org.

No third-party code is included in this repository. The nodes call these installed packages:
- ema-lightning 1.1.2 (https://github.com/canberk7/ema-lightning, Apache License 2.0): model, scheduler, decoder
- normalizer-tr (https://github.com/erdemtuna/normalizer-tr, Apache License 2.0): Turkish text normalization, used by ema-lightning

Model (not included)
--------------------
No model weights are included or downloaded by the nodes. tools/download_model.py fetches, when you run it,
canberkkkkkk/ema-lightning at a pinned revision (ema.pt, decoder.pt, config.json; Apache License 2.0 per its model card). The model
card adds: whoever deploys it is responsible for using it lawfully, including the disclosure and consent rules that apply where it is
used.

